          "short": "$1.21$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\log_5 7&=\\frac{\\log_{10}7}{\\log_{10}5}\\\\\\log_5 7&\\approx 1.21\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 12
      },
      {
